# Global360 keeps configuration per application:
#   server/.env.example       → copy to server/.env        (API, database, cookies, storage, jobs)
#   server/.env.test.example  → copy to server/.env.test   (must point at a separate *_test database)
#   client/.env.example       → copy to client/.env        (optional: API base URL for the SPA)
# Never commit real credentials. See README.md §4.
